```
Reason:
The first statement changes the early exit to a `goto out`, allowing the function to continue and apply the default memory encryption setting if the command line option is not present. The second statement directly sets `sme_me_mask` to `me_mask` when the command line option is not found, ensuring that the compile-time default is honored and memory encryption is enabled as intended.

